        Exploring Generative Process <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reward</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modeling</span> for Semi-Structured Data: A Case Study of Table Question Answering
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Tang%2C+L">Lei Tang</a>, 
      
